            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2v = 38]</span><br/>What value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: v]</span> is the solution to the given equation?</p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: 2v = 38]\nWhat value of [MATH: v] is the solution to the given equation?",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We are given the equation <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2v = 38]</span> and are asked to solve for <span class=\"math\">[MATH: v.]</span></p><p>Let&#x27;s solve the equation for <span class=\"math\">[MATH: v{:}]</span></p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2v|= 38; v|= (38)/(2); v|= 19]</span></p><p>So, the value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: v]</span> that satisfies the equation is <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 19.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We are given the equation [MATH: 2v = 38] and are asked to solve for [MATH: v.]\n\nLet's solve the equation for [MATH: v{:}]\n\n[MATH: 2v|= 38; v|= (38)/(2); v|= 19]\n\nSo, the value of [MATH: v] that satisfies the equation is [MATH: 19.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\n[MATH: 2v = 38]\nWhat value of [MATH: v] is the solution to the given equation?\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nWe are given the equation [MATH: 2v = 38] and are asked to solve for [MATH: v.]\n\nLet's solve the equation for [MATH: v{:}]\n\n[MATH: 2v|= 38; v|= (38)/(2); v|= 19]\n\nSo, the value of [MATH: v] that satisfies the equation is [MATH: 19.]"
      },
