        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>If <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 11k = 77,]</span> what is the value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 6k?]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "If [MATH: 11k = 77,] what is the value of [MATH: 6k?]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We are given the equation <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 11k = 77]</span> and are asked to find the value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 6k.]</span></p><p>First, we solve the equation for <span class=\"math\">[MATH: k{:}]</span>\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: 11k|= 77; k|= (77)/(11); k|= 7]</span></p><p>Now, we substitute <span class=\"math\">[MATH: k = 7]</span> into the expression <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 6k]</span> and simplify:\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: 6k|= 6 \u22c5 7; = 42]</span></p><p>So, the value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 6k]</span> is <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 42.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We are given the equation [MATH: 11k = 77] and are asked to find the value of [MATH: 6k.]\n\nFirst, we solve the equation for [MATH: k{:}]\n[MATH: 11k|= 77; k|= (77)/(11); k|= 7]\n\nNow, we substitute [MATH: k = 7] into the expression [MATH: 6k] and simplify:\n[MATH: 6k|= 6 \u22c5 7; = 42]\n\nSo, the value of [MATH: 6k] is [MATH: 42.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nIf [MATH: 11k = 77,] what is the value of [MATH: 6k?]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nWe are given the equation [MATH: 11k = 77] and are asked to find the value of [MATH: 6k.]\n\nFirst, we solve the equation for [MATH: k{:}]\n[MATH: 11k|= 77; k|= (77)/(11); k|= 7]\n\nNow, we substitute [MATH: k = 7] into the expression [MATH: 6k] and simplify:\n[MATH: 6k|= 6 \u22c5 7; = 42]\n\nSo, the value of [MATH: 6k] is [MATH: 42.]"
      },
